      "rule": "R1",
      "severity": "must",
      "text": "The executable duplicate-call policy does not match its documented SQLite equivalence: with `t(c TEXT COLLATE NOCASE,n)` containing `('a',1),('A',3),('a',2)`, `SELECT c,max(n+1),min(n),max(n+01) FROM t GROUP BY c` returns `'A'` in the model but `'a'` in SQLite because SQLite merges the two maximum calls. Fix: make the named comparison implement SQLite’s integer-literal equality and add this regression case."
    }
